      "preview": "אֹ֫רֶךְ: comprimento ou extensão no espaço e no tempo; longanimidade.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֹ֫רֶךְ</span></big><sub>94</sub>  <strong>s.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>comprimento, extensão</strong>—somente no singular; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:1\" href=\"/Exodus.27.1\">Ex 27:1</a> +; construto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:15\" href=\"/Genesis.6.15\">Gn 6:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְכּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:10\" href=\"/Exodus.25.10\">Ex 25:10</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְכָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.11\">2 Ch 3:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְכָּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.11\">Ez 42:11</a> etc.—<br><strong>a.</strong>  <em>Comprimento</em> da arca <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:15\" href=\"/Genesis.6.15\">Gn 6:15</a> (P), da terra de Canaã <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:17\" href=\"/Genesis.13.17\">13:17</a> (J); mais frequentemente, da arca e de outras medidas no tabernáculo e no templo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:10\" href=\"/Exodus.25.10\">Ex 25:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:17\" href=\"/Exodus.25.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:2\" href=\"/Exodus.26.2\">26:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:8\" href=\"/Exodus.26.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:1\" href=\"/Exodus.27.1\">27:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:9\" href=\"/Exodus.27.9\">9</a> + (22 vezes em Êx, P), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.2\">1 K 6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.20\">20</a> + (13 vezes em Rs e Cr), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.7\">Ez 40:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.18\">18</a> + (41 vezes em Ez) etc.<br><strong>b.</strong>  Quanto ao tempo, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יָמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 30:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.30.20\">Dt 30:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 12:12\" href=\"/Job.12.12\">Jb 12:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:5\" href=\"/Psalms.21.5\">ψ 21:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:6\" href=\"/Psalms.23.6\">23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:16\" href=\"/Psalms.91.16\">91:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:5\" href=\"/Psalms.93.5\">93:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.2\">Pr 3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:20\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.20\">La 5:20</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אַפַּיִם</span> <em>longanimidade, autocontrole</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.15\">Pr 25:15</a>.—(<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.7\">Ez 31:7</a>: 𝔊, 𝔖 e Co leem <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹב</span> em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹרֶךְ</span>; cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">5</a>, em que Co suprime o verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">ארך</span>; em <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.22\">41:22</a> leia-se provavelmente <span dir=\"rtl\">אדנו</span>, conforme 𝔊 e Sm, ou <span dir=\"rtl\">אדניו</span> conforme Co = <em>base</em>).",
