      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרוּכָה</span></big>  <strong>s.f. cura</strong> de uma ferida, <strong>restauração (</strong>propriamente a carne nova que cresce no local ferido; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أَرِيكَةٌ</span>; Fi<sup>JPh. xiii. 114–6</sup>, assim também Fl De sobre <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.8\">Is 58:8</a>; veja-se ainda Di<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.13\">2 Ch 24:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.1\">Ne 4:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֻכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.17\">Je 30:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.6\">33:6</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֻכַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.22\">Je 8:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֻכָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.8\">Is 58:8</a>;—sempre figuradamente.<br><strong>a.</strong>  <em>Cura, restauração</em> de Israel <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.8\">Is 58:8</a>; aqui com o verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">צָמַח</span>, em outras passagens com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָה</span>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.22\">Je 8:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָא</span>), com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָה</span> no hifil, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.17\">30:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.6\">33:6</a> (‖ <em>idem</em>).<br><strong>b.</strong>  <em>Restauração</em> dos muros do templo <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.13\">2 Ch 24:13</a>, dos muros de Jerusalém (cf. Fi acima) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.1\">Ne 4:1</a> (ambos com <span dir=\"rtl\">עלה</span>).",
