      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְכִּי</span></big>  <strong>adj. gentílico (</strong>derivação desconhecida<strong>)</strong>, aplicado a <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּשַׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.32\">2 S 15:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.16\">16:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.5\">17:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.33\">1 Ch 27:33</a>; com artigo = substantivo coletivo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּל הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 16:2\" href=\"/Joshua.16.2\">Jos 16:2</a> (não longe de Betel).",
