      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְנוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְנֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.fl. Arnom</strong>, uádi e curso de água em Moabe <strong>(</strong>na Estela de Mesa <span dir=\"rtl\">ארנן</span>; Thes Add, Rob, Ges e MV derivam de <span dir=\"rtl\">רנן</span>, isto é, o curso de água <em>impetuoso, rugidor</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְנוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:13\" href=\"/Numbers.21.13\">Nu 21:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:14\" href=\"/Numbers.21.14\">14</a> + 12 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְנֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:28\" href=\"/Numbers.21.28\">Nu 21:28</a> + 10 vezes—denominado fronteira entre Moabe e os amorreus <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:13\" href=\"/Numbers.21.13\">Nu 21:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:18\" href=\"/Judges.11.18\">Ju 11:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:22\" href=\"/Judges.11.22\">22</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גְּבוּל\" href=\"/BDB,_גְּבוּל\", dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּל אַרְנֹן</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:36\" href=\"/Numbers.22.36\">Nu 22:36</a>; frequentemente <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחַל אַרְנֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.24\">Dt 2:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:36\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.8\">3:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:48\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.48\">4:48</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:33\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.33\">2 K 10:33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ אַרְנוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:1\" href=\"/Joshua.12.1\">Jos 12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:2\" href=\"/Joshua.12.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:9\" href=\"/Joshua.13.9\">13:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:16\" href=\"/Joshua.13.16\">16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנְּחָלִים אַרְנוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:14\" href=\"/Numbers.21.14\">Nu 21:14</a>, isto é, os vales de cursos de água que se unem para formar o Arnom, cf. Di; também <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּמוֹת אַרְנֹן</span> <em>alturas do Arnom</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:28\" href=\"/Numbers.21.28\">Nu 21:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מעברות אַרְנוֹן</span> <em>vaus do Arnom</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.2\">Is 16:2</a>; nas demais ocorrências <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:13\" href=\"/Numbers.21.13\">Nu 21:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:24\" href=\"/Numbers.21.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:26\" href=\"/Numbers.21.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:13\" href=\"/Judges.11.13\">Ju 11:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:18\" href=\"/Judges.11.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:26\" href=\"/Judges.11.26\">26</a>; sinônimo de Moabe <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.20\">Je 48:20</a>; (cf. Tristr<sup>Moab 125 e seg.</sup>; modernamente <em>Môjib</em>).",
